"""
Tutorial 1 — Trimming.

Trim is the steady flight condition: the control inputs and states that hold every
motion derivative at zero. It is found by declaring the unknowns `missing` and letting
the initialization solver satisfy the equilibrium constraints.

  - Unknowns: thrust `T_cmd.k`, elevator `el_cmd.k`, and the plant's `alpha`/`theta`
    initial conditions (all `missing`).
  - Constraints: `initial der(...) = 0` on the states that must be steady.
  - `guess`es seed Newton; they do not bias the converged trim.

`TutorialTrim` (a zero-duration TransientAnalysis) solves the operating point.
`TutorialTrimExport` does the same solve and writes it as the package's trim assets —
`assets/trim_point.toml`, `trim_reference.toml`, `trim_controls.toml` — which every
later step loads with `apply "dyad://F16ModelWorkshop/..."`. Re-run it after changing
the flight condition or the plant. It extends `TrimExportAnalysis`
(dyad/trim_export_analysis.dyad, backed by src/trim_export_analysis.jl).

Signal flow: Constants -> Mux5 -> F16PlantModel
"""
test component TrimDemo
  # Full-physics plant (vector I/O). alpha/theta initial conditions are the
  # unknown pitch state at trim, so they are `missing`.
  f16plant = F16ModelWorkshop.Plant.F16PlantModel(alt_init = 3000.0, vt_init = 152.4, alpha_init = missing, theta_init = missing) {^f16plant}
  # Thrust and elevator trim the pitch axis -> unknowns. Lateral controls are 0.
  T_cmd = BlockComponents.Sources.Constant(k = missing) {^T_cmd}
  el_cmd = BlockComponents.Sources.Constant(k = missing) {^el_cmd}
  ail_cmd = BlockComponents.Sources.Constant(k = 0.0) {^ail_cmd}
  rud_cmd = BlockComponents.Sources.Constant(k = 0.0) {^rud_cmd}
  lef_cmd = BlockComponents.Sources.Constant(k = 0.0) {^lef_cmd}
  # Gather the 5 scalar commands into the plant's vector input port.
  mux = F16ModelWorkshop.Utils.Mux5() {^mux}
relations
  connect(T_cmd.y, mux.u1) {^id8}
  connect(el_cmd.y, mux.u2) {^id9}
  connect(ail_cmd.y, mux.u3) {^id10}
  connect(rud_cmd.y, mux.u4) {^id11}
  connect(lef_cmd.y, mux.u5) {^id12}
  connect(mux.y, f16plant.u_in) {^id13}
  # Equilibrium: speed, angle of attack, altitude, and pitch rate all steady.
  initial der(f16plant.vt) = 0.0
  initial der(f16plant.alpha) = 0.0
  initial der(f16plant.alt) = 0.0
  initial der(f16plant.Q) = 0.0
  # Newton seeds for the four unknowns.
  guess T_cmd.k = 11000.0
  guess el_cmd.k = -0.7
  guess f16plant.alpha_init = 0.06
  guess f16plant.theta_init = 0.06
metadata {
  "_links": {
    "f16plant": {
      "Dyad": {
        "placement": {
          "diagram": {"iconName": "default", "x1": 670, "y1": 410, "x2": 850, "y2": 590, "rot": 0}
        },
        "tags": []
      }
    },
    "T_cmd": {
      "Dyad": {
        "placement": {
          "diagram": {"iconName": "default", "x1": 160, "y1": 120, "x2": 260, "y2": 220, "rot": 0}
        },
